<title>UK: GOLF-WORLD RANKINGS.</title>
<headline>GOLF-WORLD RANKINGS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greg Norman remains top of the</p>
<p>world rankings issued on Monday. Colin Montgomerie moves back</p>
<p>into fifth place after winning the European Grand Prix at the</p>
<p>weekend.</p>
<p>Top 20 (U.S. unless stated):</p>
<p>  1. Greg Norman (Australia)	 10.57 points average</p>
<p>  2. Tiger Woods			  9.79</p>
<p>  3. Nick Price			   9.20</p>
<p>  4. Tom Lehman			   9.06</p>
<p>  5. Colin Montgomerie (Britain)    8.73</p>
<p>  6. Steve Elkington (Australia)    8.67</p>
<p>  7. Masashi Oxaki (Japan)	    8.18</p>
<p>  8. Ernie Els (South Africa)	 7.80</p>
<p>  9. Mark O'Meara			 7.55</p>
<p> 10. Phil Mickelson		     7.24</p>
<p> 11. Nick Faldo			   7.14</p>
<p> 12. Scott Hoch			   6.76</p>
<p> 13. Brad Faxon			   6.74</p>
<p> 14. Fred Couples			 6.74</p>
<p> 15. Davis Love			   5.80</p>
<p> 16. Jesper Parnevik (Sweden)	 5.74</p>
<p> 17. Steve Jones			  5.72</p>
<p> 18. Bernhard Langer (Germany)	5.60</p>
<p> 19. Ian Woosnam (Britain)	    5.58</p>
<p> 20. Vijay Singh (Fiji)		 5.18</p>
